Fellow Braves,

Thank you for your continued support of Brave's Rage!

Since Brave’s Rage’s Global Early Access in June, we have tons of positive reviews and feedback from the community. We’d love to express our sincere thanks to all our Braves to help shape Brave’s Rage into how it looks today!

You may have noticed a slowdown in the update frequency lately – We are actually NOT　slacking off! The devs are busy creating new contents while polishing the game in all areas. We will consolidate all these into a BIG patch that hopefully will be available to you all soon.

Here is a sneak peak at what are included:

• New stories and endings;
• New cards and gear;
• New gameplay mode;
• New enemies (Big, bad, and scary we promise);
• LOTS of new cosmetics (“Alter egos”);
• Fine-tuned challenge tier settings;
• Balance changes for a smoother gameplay experience;
• And of course, a highly-anticipated NEW BRAVE!

As always, we actively listen to the voices of our community so please do not hesitate to reach out to us with your comments, suggestions, or concerns.

Stay tuned!

Much appreciated,
Dev Team
